# Build context for docker/frontend/Dockerfile is the repo root (it needs
# both frontend/ and docker/frontend/Caddyfile) — everything below is
# irrelevant to that build and only slows down `docker build`'s own context
# upload. The backend has its own, separate backend/.dockerignore.
.git
.gitignore
*.md
node_modules
backend
.env
.env.*
!.env.*.example
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage
